          "Weapon"
        ],
        "name": "Emergent Horrors",
        "target": "One creature or object",
        "type": "feature",
        "usage": "Main action"
      },
      {
        "effects": [
          {
            "effect": "While the handmaiden is [winded](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.health/winded), they gain an [edge](scc.v1:mcdm.heroes.v1/rule.dice/edge) on strikes, and any strike made against them gains an edge."
